# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public legal and privacy endpoints: documents, processing activities,
# transparency report, tokenized case status, tokenized appeal.
# WHEN:  After legal-document versioning changes; after every LegalCase state
#        change (use with 80-admin-legal.http to walk the full flow);
#        transparency after decisions to see aggregates move.
# WHY:   These endpoints are legally required surfaces (GDPR/e-commerce);
#        the token endpoints must never leak data without the exact token.
# WHERE: Any environment (read endpoints are safe); appeals only where a
#        real decided case + appeal token exists.
# AUTH:  None - security is via unguessable hashed tokens.
# TOKENS: caseNumber/statusToken are auto-captured by 30-reviews.http;
#        appealToken arrives via (outbox) mail - copy it into
#        http-client.private.env.json.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Active Impressum (types: imprint | privacyPolicy | termsOfUse)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/legal/documents/imprint

### Active Datenschutzerklaerung
GET {{host}}/api/v1/legal/documents/privacyPolicy

### Active Nutzungsbedingungen
GET {{host}}/api/v1/legal/documents/termsOfUse

### Unknown document type variant
# EXPECT: 400/404 ProblemDetails.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/legal/documents/doesNotExist

### All published versions of a document (version history transparency)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/legal/documents/privacyPolicy/versions

### Processing-activities record (GDPR Art. 30) - generated and test-covered
GET {{host}}/api/v1/legal/processing-activities

### Transparency report for a year (aggregates only, no personal data)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/legal/transparency-report?year=2026

### Case status by confidential token (what the reporter link opens)
# Uses values captured by "Report a review" in 30-reviews.http.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/legal/cases/{{caseNumber}}/status?token={{statusToken}}

### Case status - wrong token variant
# EXPECT: 404 (no information leak about case existence).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/legal/cases/{{caseNumber}}/status?token=wrong-token

### Submit an appeal (token from the decision notification mail)
# Only valid on a decided case, within the >= 6 month appeal window.
# "website" is the honeypot again.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/legal/cases/{{caseNumber}}/appeal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{appealToken}}",
  "text": "Ich lege Einspruch ein: Die Tatsachenbehauptung in der Bewertung ist durch Belege gedeckt und daher zulaessig.",
  "website": ""
}

### Appeal - honeypot variant
# EXPECT: 202 generic acknowledgement, nothing stored.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/legal/cases/{{caseNumber}}/appeal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{appealToken}}",
  "text": "Automatisierter Einspruch-Spam mit ausgefuelltem Honeypot-Feld.",
  "website": "https://spam.example"
}

### Appeal - invalid token variant
# EXPECT: 404 ProblemDetails.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/legal/cases/{{caseNumber}}/appeal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "invalid-token",
  "text": "Dieser Einspruch darf mangels gueltigem Token nicht angenommen werden.",
  "website": ""
}
